# The pass that names General Textures Collection as well as the two mods of wdi-ab. It is the one
# in which this mod's trouser step has art to read: General carries a retexture of the trousers with
# a waistband, belt loops and a fly, but its LoadFolders only loads it when XeoNovaDan's Visible
# Pants is active, so with AB active instead it never reaches a pawn unless this mod reads it.
# Select it with `Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -DepMap wsl-deps.wdi-ab-general.map`.
# One line per mod: packageId then its Workshop id.
#
# WDI and AB are here for the reasons given in wsl-deps.wdi-ab.map, and AB needs its settings file
# to do anything at all: see config/wdi-ab-general/. astryl.tailormade is resolved by wsl-ids.map.
wdi.realistic.bodies   3527486510
ab.vplrf               2986402536
kas.generalcollection  3789119336

# The inspect-tab steps 02-gear-tab.feature needs, as a PickleTools package on the stock Pickle
# rather than through -PickleSrc: see wsl-deps.map, which carries the same line for the bare pass.
nelim.pickletools.inspecttabs   path:PickleTools/InspectTabs/Mod
